        "body": "### Body Words\n\nhead ｜ face ｜ eyes ｜ ears ｜ nose ｜ mouth ｜ hair ｜ hands ｜ feet ｜ legs ｜ body\n\n### Feeling Words\n\nhappy ｜ sad ｜ angry ｜ tired ｜ excited ｜ scared\n\n### Body-Action Input\n\nTouch your head. ｜ Touch your ears. ｜ Touch your nose. ｜ Open your mouth. ｜ Show me your hands. ｜ Show me your feet. ｜ Clap your hands. ｜ Stamp your feet. ｜ Point to your eyes.\n\n### Feeling Input and Supported Chunks\n\nHow do you feel? ｜ Are you happy? ｜ Are you sad? ｜ Show me a happy face. ｜ Show me a sad face. ｜ Show me an angry face. ｜ My hands. ｜ My feet. ｜ It's OK.\n\n### Optional Sentence Models for Ready Children\n\n[Optional Challenge] I'm happy. ｜ [Optional Challenge] I'm sad. ｜ [Optional Challenge] I'm tired."
